WEBVTT

00:13.041 --> 00:15.458
Leave Chinatown to follow me
and you shall live.

00:15.583 --> 00:17.458
Otherwise, you shall die.

00:20.041 --> 00:22.666
Since the bloody battle at Chinatown,

00:22.833 --> 00:24.291
security has been tightened.

00:24.416 --> 00:26.500
The eradication of rogues
has been accelerated.

00:26.666 --> 00:29.250
The era of territorial rivalry is over.

00:30.708 --> 00:33.041
Long, Phong, Ba

00:33.166 --> 00:36.291
withdrew from the criminal world
according to the wish of Hung Chinatown.

00:36.458 --> 00:39.208
The gangland at that time was a calm lake.

00:40.041 --> 00:42.708
Until someone tries to stir it up.

00:52.625 --> 00:55.125
The blood debt must be paid with blood.

00:56.958 --> 01:00.583
A storm coming from The North Port
stirs Chinatown once more.

01:23.416 --> 01:24.750
Hey, dude.

01:24.833 --> 01:26.958
Is there any unique cuisine out here?

01:27.666 --> 01:29.166
Do Son chicken.

01:29.250 --> 01:30.250
- Phong.
- What?

01:30.250 --> 01:31.833
Let's try special chicken here.

01:32.041 --> 01:33.375
What kind of chicken?

01:35.125 --> 01:36.833
"45kg chicks".

01:37.583 --> 01:40.166
Dude, can you take us to
try it out when you're free?

01:40.625 --> 01:42.125
Why are you so excited?

01:42.125 --> 01:44.166
Are you crazy?
Ut Det would kill me if she knew.

01:44.458 --> 01:45.791
I'm asking for you.

01:47.833 --> 01:49.166
You're really my best friend.

02:02.208 --> 02:03.333
Wait.

02:03.333 --> 02:04.541
Where is Big brother going?

02:05.833 --> 02:08.791
Don't worry. VIP treatment is different.

02:18.916 --> 02:21.333
How is Kim's business doing?

02:23.625 --> 02:24.916
Pretty good, sir.

02:59.750 --> 03:01.125
Are you being agitated?

03:10.575 --> 03:11.879
Bitch!

04:17.208 --> 04:18.458
Big brother!

04:24.250 --> 04:25.500
Brother Cuong.

04:25.750 --> 04:27.000
Sorry I'm late.

04:30.375 --> 04:32.041
[Reunion]

04:37.958 --> 04:39.208
Thank you.

04:41.333 --> 04:43.625
There would be no me if it weren't for you.

04:43.666 --> 04:45.958
I have a lifetime of debt to you.

04:46.375 --> 04:47.750
Please don't thank me.

04:48.000 --> 04:49.666
Have you heard anything about Hung?

04:50.541 --> 04:53.000
He is nothing more than a rabid dog
under Ky's command.

04:53.041 --> 04:55.333
He bites anyone Ky commands him to.

04:57.375 --> 04:59.041
Would it be too much trouble for you

04:59.958 --> 05:01.583
...if I wanted to see Ky?

05:03.958 --> 05:06.250
I know everything has its price.

05:07.458 --> 05:08.916
In this area,

05:09.041 --> 05:12.625
... anyone who wants to
oppose him, will be killed.

05:12.791 --> 05:14.750
But don't you have any other ways?

05:18.416 --> 05:19.833
I'll try then.

05:21.000 --> 05:23.458
But I guess you did not come here
alone this time, are you?

05:41.250 --> 05:42.625
So sexy.

05:42.666 --> 05:44.125
Smells so good.

05:46.375 --> 05:48.375
What is he doing in there
that takes so long?

05:48.958 --> 05:50.750
Who knows?

05:59.208 --> 06:00.458
Here.

06:00.500 --> 06:02.041
I looked for it everywhere.

06:02.125 --> 06:04.500
Wow, how nice!

06:04.541 --> 06:06.125
Thank you!

06:13.416 --> 06:14.500
I'm sorry.

06:14.916 --> 06:16.083
It's okay.

06:31.583 --> 06:32.666
Ouch! It hurts!

06:32.666 --> 06:33.750
I'm sorry.

06:35.541 --> 06:37.041
Those bastards.

06:37.041 --> 06:40.458
Such a waste to feed
those useless assholes.

06:41.416 --> 06:45.041
Do you mean the security guards
or the rogues that beat me up?

06:45.291 --> 06:46.666
Both of them.

06:47.041 --> 06:47.791
Next time…

06:47.833 --> 06:50.833
I'll kill them if I encounter
them next time.

06:50.875 --> 06:53.375
You said exactly the same thing last time.

06:53.875 --> 06:55.458
Come on, don't move.

06:57.041 --> 06:58.250
Hey.

06:58.416 --> 06:59.916
Why did you choose this job?

07:00.791 --> 07:03.916
You've been living with me for
three years and you still ask about it?

07:04.041 --> 07:05.666
How frightened!

07:06.041 --> 07:08.458
Just answer me.

07:10.625 --> 07:12.583
Well, at least I'm grateful for this job.

07:13.208 --> 07:16.166
Thanks to it, I have a place to live.

07:16.291 --> 07:17.791
Ms. Kim also treats me well.

07:17.958 --> 07:19.750
And… I also have you.

07:21.375 --> 07:24.541
Aren't you afraid of having another one?

07:24.583 --> 07:26.500
There's a kid already in your village.

07:27.458 --> 07:28.833
You're also doing this.

07:29.208 --> 07:30.833
It feels good, though.

07:30.916 --> 07:32.458
What is there to be afraid?

07:33.291 --> 07:34.708
You little brat.

07:35.250 --> 07:36.625
Hey.

07:36.666 --> 07:38.333
How long are you planning to do this?

07:39.500 --> 07:41.791
Are you forcing me to retire?

07:44.125 --> 07:45.375
Here.

07:45.416 --> 07:48.875
I'll think about it later
when she's eighteen.

07:51.333 --> 07:53.375
So, when are you going to quit?

07:53.583 --> 07:55.041
- Me?
- Yeah.

07:56.375 --> 07:57.791
I…

07:58.291 --> 07:59.625
Once you stop, I'll stop as well.

08:00.958 --> 08:02.416
Then let's do it forever.

08:04.041 --> 08:05.916
Aren't you hurt? Don't move.

08:17.000 --> 08:20.583
Excuse me, have you seen this woman
around here recently?

08:21.916 --> 08:23.083
No.

08:36.291 --> 08:37.500
Excuse me.

08:38.458 --> 08:39.750
May I ask

08:40.166 --> 08:41.666
if you have seen this woman recently?

08:43.666 --> 08:45.041
It's a juicy girl!

08:50.750 --> 08:52.041
How about this one?

08:55.200 --> 08:57.000
He looks cool but strange.

08:58.333 --> 09:00.416
We don't know. Go away.

09:01.833 --> 09:03.041
Thanks anyway.

09:17.250 --> 09:18.833
Dude, do you have a lighter?

09:20.666 --> 09:21.916
Who the fuck are you?

09:22.708 --> 09:24.000
What are you doing here?

09:26.041 --> 09:27.458
Why are you looking for Hac Hung?

09:30.291 --> 09:31.583
Hey, what are you doing?

09:32.000 --> 09:34.125
- What happened?
- Let's call the police

09:34.125 --> 09:35.458
Seriously, was he beaten to death?

09:35.458 --> 09:36.916
Call an ambulance.

09:46.000 --> 09:47.916
When will this kind of life end, dad?

09:50.541 --> 09:53.041
All peace has its price.

09:55.708 --> 09:57.125
It's not your business.

09:57.333 --> 10:00.250
No matter what happens or not,
we keep moving from places to places.

10:00.250 --> 10:01.958
Living in the shadow like a rat.

10:02.666 --> 10:04.541
And losing the people we love one by one

10:04.708 --> 10:06.375
is the price of all this?

11:23.375 --> 11:24.791
Hai Cuong asked to see you.

11:25.208 --> 11:28.250
What? Why didn't you call him come here?

11:30.916 --> 11:32.625
So it would be easier for you to strike?

11:33.125 --> 11:34.625
The mess you did at the airport...

11:35.708 --> 11:37.208
...was over the line.

11:46.208 --> 11:47.333
Sis Kim.

11:53.750 --> 11:54.875
Because of you,

11:55.458 --> 11:57.208
I lost my prey.

11:57.375 --> 11:58.791
Who do you think you are?

11:59.583 --> 12:00.750
Huh?

12:00.791 --> 12:02.250
How dare you get in my way?

12:24.291 --> 12:25.500
Sis Kim.

12:26.583 --> 12:27.958
Are you really terrified?

12:29.125 --> 12:30.541
I was just joking.

12:35.541 --> 12:36.875
I'm sorry.

12:36.916 --> 12:39.041
If Hai Cuong wants to see me,

12:39.041 --> 12:41.208
ask him the meeting time.

12:44.458 --> 12:45.875
9 o'clock tomorrow night.

12:46.958 --> 12:48.291
Okay.

12:58.166 --> 12:59.416
Ms. Kim.

13:00.458 --> 13:01.458
You are…?

13:01.500 --> 13:02.916
I'm from Chinatown.

13:04.541 --> 13:06.291
Did Big brother have something to tell me?

13:06.583 --> 13:07.750
No, he didn't.

13:08.500 --> 13:09.833
Then what?

13:10.333 --> 13:11.916
Oh, I want your help to find this one.

13:12.208 --> 13:13.875
I guess Hien told you already, didn't he?

13:18.416 --> 13:20.041
Do you know Big brother is here?

13:21.958 --> 13:23.166
What?

13:31.416 --> 13:32.750
Ba.

13:34.666 --> 13:35.875
Ba.

13:37.916 --> 13:39.166
Answer the phone.

13:40.541 --> 13:42.541
It's your ringtone.

13:53.416 --> 13:55.208
- Hello?
- Where is Ba?

13:56.166 --> 13:57.625
Ba? Hey, Ba.

13:58.166 --> 13:59.541
Long is calling you.

14:00.291 --> 14:01.583
Who?

14:05.041 --> 14:07.000
Ba is at his hometown, of course.

14:07.041 --> 14:08.541
He's taking care of his wife.

14:08.583 --> 14:09.833
Where are you then?

14:09.958 --> 14:11.416
I…

14:12.541 --> 14:14.666
I'm… I'm driving.

14:14.791 --> 14:16.041
I'm driving.

14:16.041 --> 14:17.000
Yeah.

14:17.041 --> 14:19.041
Is there anything else? Hurry.

14:19.500 --> 14:20.750
How is the food stall?

14:22.458 --> 14:24.041
Here's your three-month rental fee.

14:26.333 --> 14:27.541
Thank you.

14:29.291 --> 14:31.750
Jeez… I thought you were threatening me.

14:31.833 --> 14:32.666
You scared me.

14:32.708 --> 14:35.166
How about the furniture in here?

14:35.791 --> 14:38.750
I'll leave them all to you if you want.

14:38.833 --> 14:40.375
It's a piece of cake.

14:40.583 --> 14:41.833
Gosh.

14:41.875 --> 14:43.333
He's got a car?

14:43.666 --> 14:45.000
How cool!

14:46.583 --> 14:48.125
Thank you.

14:49.916 --> 14:52.958
Oh… It's been doing well.
Pretty good.

14:53.000 --> 14:55.125
I have to drive now.

14:55.166 --> 14:57.666
Let's talk later. Okay? Bye.

15:00.541 --> 15:02.041
Holy mother of God.

15:02.166 --> 15:04.375
- Did he suspect?
- No idea.

15:16.333 --> 15:17.458
Those assholes.

15:25.416 --> 15:29.708
 [9 P.M - The North Port train station]

16:00.125 --> 16:01.333
Big brother!

16:01.416 --> 16:02.833
You picked a nice place.

16:24.041 --> 16:25.833
Big brother. My treat.

16:27.333 --> 16:29.250
Why didn't you inform me
that you came here?

16:30.416 --> 16:32.333
Have you explored the entire city so far?

16:34.791 --> 16:36.416
Where do you hide Hung?

16:37.416 --> 16:38.708
I have no clue.

16:38.958 --> 16:41.500
But if you need, I'll find him immediately.

16:43.166 --> 16:46.875
East port, bus station. I don't care.

16:46.875 --> 16:49.000
- Oh.
- Even the city center.

16:50.583 --> 16:53.875
However, do not touch Chinatown.

17:00.958 --> 17:02.583
Chinatown has become outdated.

17:03.958 --> 17:05.958
You should take care of yourself.

17:06.625 --> 17:08.375
Take good care of you.

17:10.125 --> 17:11.833
You should retire early.

17:15.625 --> 17:17.958
If you hand Chinatown over to me,

17:19.958 --> 17:21.291
I promise

17:22.500 --> 17:24.041
I won't let you down.

17:31.000 --> 17:32.541
Bring Hac Hung to me,

17:35.791 --> 17:37.708
and I will let it slide.

17:42.750 --> 17:44.041
How uptight!

17:57.750 --> 17:59.583
But I cannot let it slide,

18:01.041 --> 18:02.916
since I need Chinatown.

18:05.625 --> 18:06.875
Big brother!

18:12.125 --> 18:13.625
One more step and I'll shoot you.

18:15.708 --> 18:17.583
Why were you so reckless?

18:17.791 --> 18:19.250
I thought you came to negotiate?

20:04.416 --> 20:05.791
Phong!

20:17.833 --> 20:19.166
Are you okay?

20:19.583 --> 20:21.041
Why don't you answer me.

20:21.333 --> 20:23.791
Okay my ass. It hurts like hell!

20:48.875 --> 20:50.541
Don't touch my brothers.

21:14.000 --> 21:15.125
You bastards.

21:15.208 --> 21:16.291
Well said!

21:16.333 --> 21:17.541
I'm talking about you two.

21:50.791 --> 21:51.875
Are you guys okay?

23:02.583 --> 23:03.833
Nobody move!
